      "google_reviews_json": "{\"place_id\":\"ChIJ1y0P2DzVwkcR4QTUOMXVaMM\",\"rating\":4.7,\"user_rating_count\":347,\"google_maps_uri\":\"https://maps.google.com/?cid=14080739278012548321\",\"fetched_at\":\"2026-11-12T19:30:58+01:00\",\"reviews\":[{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-11-10T15:07:15+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a moins d'une semaine\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Pap's\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118443942445762345759/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJlXccH9ohKuWokwy811d85Zu07QzrUyd2DqI9yEOXzqA4p=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Très bon accueil. Cuisine maison.\\nAvec un ami, nous avons eu l'occasion de discuter avec le chef en fin de service, établissement transmis de père a fils.\\nBravo et merci a l'équipe.\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-20T16:09:25+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 3 semaines\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Christophe Boutin\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116372029629903687170/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKCGjJrRY0b5bFtp285S-H9IAq1-Ey_PhvNvSZwM4IQ6_bMbQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Super découverte pour un dimanche midi que ce petit resto traditionnel avec sa cuisine du jour comme chez mamie pour un super tarif. Portions généreuses, personnel adorable. C'etait plein, pensez a réserver\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-10-12T21:43:58+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a un mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Hélène Dewitte\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101735087811270851561/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ1clZHI1Y325f_BrNQKw3TcQMa2u8z2cF2X7ey97SZNqj_Pw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":5,\"text\":\"Nous avons passé un très bon moment à La Garenne. Accueil sympathique, équipe souriante et service attentionné.\\n\\nLes plats étaient généreux, bien présentés et délicieux, le tout dans une ambiance conviviale.\\n\\nUne adresse que je recommande sans hésiter. Nous reviendrons avec plaisir ! 👍😊\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-09-09T13:48:27+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 2 mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"Stéph Maât\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108140019785237942208/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXtbzgU8sfknWPMY4aQ_Jzo_KMgTV7rFnCvefsN5NP7YxsTuUhm=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"rating\":4,\"text\":\"\",\"language_code\":\"\",\"publish_time\":\"2026-09-08T11:03:35+00:00\",\"relative_publish_time\":\"il y a 2 mois\",\"author\":{\"display_name\":\"De Maret Brigitte\",\"uri\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115673610262883226562/reviews\",\"photo_uri\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKr41lYw7KQo-MycsIgWw9riLYHgnuzLe69Y82vqn2Na-etdw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\"},\"google_maps_uri\":\"\"}]}",
